      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Open Form: Rearrangeable Images",
      "links": [],
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[pieces intended to be rearranged at will by the spectator,\nthe collector, or the curator]",
      "links": [],
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/Agam1953-006-s.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "355",
      "height": "200",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Yaacov\nAgam: 8 + 1 in motion, 1953.\n\n\n\nThe white sticks can be repositioned and rotated.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/PaulTalman65Kugelbild-1.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "200",
      "height": "200",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/PaulTalman65Kugelbild-2.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "199",
      "height": "200",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Paul Talman: Kugelbilder, 1965.\n\n\n\nThe two-colored balls can be rotated.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Superposition",
      "links": [],
      "level": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/rauschenberg-Rauschenberg64Shades-S.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "159",
      "height": "165",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Robert\nRauschenberg: Shades, 1964.\n(6 plexiglass panels which can be arbitrarily repositioned.)\n\n\n\n\"Mathematicians have calculated that there are over six million\ndifferent arrangements of Shades.\" [Edward A. Foster: Robert\nRauschenberg: Prints 1948/1970, the Minneapolis Institute of Arts,\n1970.]",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/rauschenberg-Rauschenberg67Revolver2.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "Robert Rauschenberg: Revolvers,\n1967\n\n(2 parts: one colored, one black & white).\n\n5 plexiglass panels which can be arbitrarily rotated.",
      "width": "211",
      "height": "165",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/rauschenberg-Rauschenberg67Revolver1.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "177",
      "height": "165",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/anything/open-form/rearrangeable-painting/rauschenberg-Rauschenberg67PassportS.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "Robert\nRauschenberg: Passport,\n1967.\n\n(3 plexiglass\npanels.)",
      "width": "165",
      "height": "165",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Hein Eberson (Trademark™): U-frame,\n1999.",
